<title>USA: Aon Corp unit completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Aon Corp unit completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aon Corp's Aon Warranty Group Inc unit on Thursday said it completed the acquisition of Innovative Services International of Golden, Colorado.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Innovative specializes in customer care services, technical support for most consumer products, customer relations, warranty marketing, warranty administration, warranty brokerage, risk management, and enhancement products and services.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
